  <div id="sutta">
  
    <h4 id="thag2.11" class="h1">Thag 2:11  Mahā Cunda</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Listening well increases learning.</p>
              <p>What is learned increases discernment.</p>
              <p>Through discernment one knows the goal.</p>
              <p>When known, the goal brings bliss.</p>
              <p>Stay in isolated lodgings;</p>
              <p>live for freedom from fetters.</p>
              <p>If you don’t attain delight there,</p>
              <p>then live in the Saṅgha,</p>
              <p>your mind protected,</p>
              <p>mindful.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
